<title>BRAZIL: Brazil sets commercial dlr buy/sell tender.</title>
<headline>Brazil sets commercial dlr buy/sell tender.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Central Bank announced an auction in commercial foreign exchange market requiring buy and sell offers from financial institutions, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auction was announced before the market's opening. On Tuesday, the real was asked at 1.0194 reais per dollar and bid at 1.0195 reais per greenback in late session, they added.</p>
<p>-- Alexandre Caverni, Sao Paulo newsroom, 55-11-2324411.</p>
</text>
